    {"type": "text", "id": "qb_text", "x": 1196, "y": 146, "width": 450, "height": 240, "text": "Why is decode memory-bound?    -> 02, 03\nWhat does PagedAttention fix?  -> 04\nStatic vs continuous batching? -> 03\nHow does prefix caching work?  -> 05\nWhen does speculation hurt?    -> 06\nWhat does int8 KV cost?        -> 07\nWhy is vLLM still faster?      -> 07, 08\nHow big is the KV cache?       -> 02", "originalText": "Why is decode memory-bound?    -> 02, 03\nWhat does PagedAttention fix?  -> 04\nStatic vs continuous batching? -> 03\nHow does prefix caching work?  -> 05\nWhen does speculation hurt?    -> 06\nWhat does int8 KV cost?        -> 07\nWhy is vLLM still faster?      -> 07, 08\nHow big is the KV cache?       -> 02", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "roughness": 1},

